{"type":"seed","doc_id":"d3_django_index","fact_refs":[1,2,3],"question":"How do Django's topic guides, reference guides, and how-to guides differ from each other?","answer":"Topic guides discuss key concepts at a high level with background explanation; reference guides give technical API reference assuming basic understanding of key concepts; how-to guides are recipes for addressing specific problems and use-cases, and are more advanced than tutorials."}
